which tensions or tradeoffs the input makes visible, which alternative
cuts you considered and rejected. Downstream tiers don't read this
intro, but when sysarch regenerates with feedback you (or a later
model) can refer back to it to stay anchored in your initial framing
instead of restarting from scratch.

